<title>ITALY: Italian BTP/bund spread narrows to 160 bp.</title>
<headline>Italian BTP/bund spread narrows to 160 bp.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread between the 10-year benchmark Italian BTP bond and German bund narrowed to a record 160 basis points, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1550 GMT, the BTP July 1 2006 was quoted at 109.76 to give a yield of 7.43 percent, while the bund 15/306 gave a yield of 5.83 percent.</p>
<p>Earlier, the LIFFE BTP March futures contract hit a record high of 130.27.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
